---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Arweave - Permanent information storage">
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Arweave",
      "url": "https://arweave.org",
      "description": "Arweave is a global, permissionless hard drive that stores data permanently and incentivizes nodes to keep it.",
      "logo": "https://arweave.org/logo.png"
    }
  </script>
  <main class="main-content" role="main">
    <div class="content-container">
      <!-- Main Headline -->
      <h1 id="main-headline" class="main-headline">Arweave.</h1>
      
      <!-- Subheadline -->
      <h2 class="subheadline">Permanent information storage.</h2>
      
      <!-- Content Blocks -->
      <div class="content-blocks">
        <p>
          As a collective network in the Blockweave, Arweave allows developers 
          and end-users to permanently store their data on-chain. Forever.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          As a transaction protocol, Arweave can be used with any framework. 
          The Blockweave is truly decentralized - a new paradigm that could 
          revolutionize how we think about data permanence.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          With Arweave's innovative fee structure, the permaweb becomes accessible 
          to everyone, everywhere.
        </p>
        
        <p>
          Information storage becomes effortless, cost-effective, and energy-efficient. 
          The Arweave ecosystem empowers you to build virtually anything - from simple 
          apps to internet-scale applications that last forever.
        </p>
        
        <a href="#" class="fee-link" aria-label="Read more about fees">Read the fee ></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <!-- Footer Section -->
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-content">
      <span class="copyright">© arweave.org 2024, something is you like as PT</span>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/legal-policies/" class="footer-link">Terms of use</a>
        <span class="footer-separator">|</span>
        <a href="/legal-policies/" class="footer-link">Privacy policy</a>
        <span class="footer-separator">|</span>
        <a href="/brand-kit/" class="footer-link">Brand-kit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Main Layout - Left-aligned, compact */
  .main-content {
    padding: 15px 40px 40px 15px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .content-container {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  /* Typography - Compact spacing to match wireframe */
  .main-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    font-size: var(--text-headline-large-size);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: var(--text-headline-large-line-height);
    letter-spacing: var(--text-headline-large-letter-spacing);
    color: var(--primary-black);
    margin: 0 0 8px 0; /* Reduced from var(--space-md) */
    text-align: left;
  }
  
  .subheadline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-section-header-size);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: var(--text-section-header-line-height);
    letter-spacing: var(--text-section-header-letter-spacing);
    color: var(--primary-gray);
    margin: 0 0 32px 0; /* Increased for better vertical rhythm */
    text-align: left;
  }
  
  /* Content blocks with tight spacing */
  .content-blocks {
    text-align: left;
  }
  
  .content-blocks p {
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #000000;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0; /* Increased from 12px to 20px for better spacing */
    text-align: left;
  }
  
  .content-blocks p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 20px; /* Consistent spacing before link */
  }
  
  /* Fee link - Inline with content flow */
  .fee-link {
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: #000000;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .fee-link:hover {
    color: #F66700;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  .fee-link:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #F66700;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  
  /* Footer Layout */
  .site-footer {
    padding: 20px 15px;
    margin: 48px 0 0 0; /* Increased top margin for better spacing */
  }
  
  .footer-content {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  
  .copyright {
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 16px;
    color: #A0AEC0;
  }
  
  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  
  .footer-link {
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 16px;
    color: #A0AEC0;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  .footer-link:hover {
    color: #A8AFB3;
  }
  
  .footer-separator {
    font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #A0AEC0;
  }
  
  /* Responsive Design */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .main-content {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    
    .main-headline {
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 42px;
    }
    
    .subheadline {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    
    .content-blocks p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 21px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    
    .content-blocks p:last-of-type {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    
    .site-footer {
      padding: 20px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    
    .footer-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 12px;
    }
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199px) {
    .main-content {
      padding: 30px;
    }
    
    .main-headline {
      font-size: 42px;
      line-height: 48px;
    }
    
    .subheadline {
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 26px;
    }
  }
</style>
